#  Wine Quality Exploratory Data Analysis

##  Objective

Analyze the Wine Quality Dataset using Python and Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) techniques to identify the factors that influence wine quality.

##  Dataset

**Wine Quality Dataset**

##  Tools Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn

## 📊 Project Workflow

* Data Loading
* Data Cleaning
* Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
* Descriptive Statistics
* Correlation Analysis
* Outlier Detection
* Filtering & Sorting
* Data Visualization
* Observations & Conclusion

##  Concepts Covered

* Statistics
* Correlation Matrix
* NumPy
* Pandas
* Data Visualization
* Outlier Detection

